      text: "\u1ED2, Ki\u1EC1n \u0111\u1EA5y \xE0. V\u0169 kh\xED c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\xE3 s\u1EB5n s\xE0ng \u2014 ta v\u1EEBa m\xE0i l\u1EA1i l\u01B0\u1EE1i \u0111\xEAm qua."
    - speaker: "\xD4ng T\u1EC5"
      text: "\u0110i th\u1EED m\u1ED9t l\u01B0\u1EE3t combo tr\xEAn s\xE2n cho ch\u1EAFc tay. R\u1ED3i theo d\u1EA5u m\xE0 v\xE0o r\u1EEBng."
    startQuestOnEnd: 
    reportObjectiveOnEnd: q1:talk_ongte
    claimQuestOnEnd: q1
    giveItemOnEnd: 
    setFlagOnEnd: 
